{"id":"457972","name":"西红柿金针菇蛋汤","author":"lengnina","authorId":"701321","desc":"","cover":"images/457972/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"一个"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"一小把"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"两个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"一棵"},{"name":"浓汤宝","amount":"半块"},{"name":"盐","amount":"一小勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"一勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"西红柿去皮切片，金针菇切两段，鸡蛋打散，葱分开切。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/201905111557564143267701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"起锅烧油，爆香葱白，放西红柿片。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/201905111557564215456701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"西红柿炒出汁放入一勺生抽。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/201905111557564267807701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"放水，水量按照人数来，我只有一个人的量，放入一小块浓汤宝，放一小勺盐。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/201905111557564339245701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"汤煮开放入金针菇。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/201905111557564393671701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"再次煮开淋入鸡蛋液，煮出蛋花。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/201905111557564488620701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后撒葱叶，成品。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/201905111557564547573701321.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}